Design a 4-input NOR gate circuit. This module takes four single-bit inputs (A, B, C, D) and produces a single output (Y) that is LOW if any of the inputs are HIGH. The circuit achieves this by utilizing a series of NOR gates to first combine pairs of inputs and then further consolidate their results, effectively implementing a logical NOR operation across all inputs.
